g to fix, honestly flagged:** `serve.mjs` currently binds `0.0.0.0:8788` with no auth — fine as a scratch tool, but the plan says fold the dashboard under the portal origin rather than leaving a second unauthenticated LAN origin as the long-term answer.\n\n**Message to Antigravity:** same as before, plus — *\"Steps 7–8 are now in IMPROVEMENTS.md: adopt the inline-SVG pattern from `scratch/longview_run/dashboard/dashboard.html` as the only e-ink graph approach, add a lite/full rendering tier with manual override, and build the Mission Control action registry exactly as specified — allowlisted names only, session-authed, audited, two-tap confirm. Propose the registry v1 list back to me before wiring any action.\"*\n\nThe \"economic\" part writes itself: an e-ink terminal with weeks of battery driving local models means the marginal cost of every query and every run is zero cloud spend — worth surfacing as a small token/run stats tile from the ledger, if you want the portal to *show* its economics rather than just have them."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":110294,"output_tokens":1070,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":802,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1070,"cache_read_input_tokens":110294,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":802},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ccv7xwxcYfnw4zeTJoPXc","type":"assistant","uuid":"0b28f93c-ec53-45b8-825e-c573b5fa44f5","timestamp":"2026-07-11T10:35:12.931Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16","sessionId":"96450f51-d651-4f84-a2b8-70f86383cafe","version":"2.1.202